{
  "$schema": "https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema",
  "$id": "root-tail/1",
  "title": "Root counts of instrument polynomials at the primes between the rough bound and B",
  "description": "For each instrument polynomial file and side, the projective root counts r_p of the homogeneous form at every prime p in (from, bound], summed in bins of ln p (src/bin/d1_tail.rs). Over coprime pairs a value is divisible by p with probability r_p/(p+1) against 1/p for an integer; eta_p = (r_p p - p - 1)/(p^2 - 1) is that excess scaled by p/(p-1), the quantity the exact first-order term of docs/baseline_calibration.md section 9 needs. A region whose b stays below p never meets the root at infinity; there eta_p^aff = (r_p^aff - 1)/(p - 1) over the affine roots alone is the excess (table column eta_affine). Likewise a region whose |a| stays below p meets the root 0 only at (0, 1); eta_zero sums 1/(p - 1) over the primes at which 0 is a root, the amount that removes from eta_affine. alpha_tail = -Sum eta_p ln p equals Murphy alpha over the same primes wherever p divides neither the discriminant nor the leading coefficient.",
  "type": "object",
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "required": [
    "schema_version",
    "ts_ms",
    "from",
    "bound",
    "bin_width",
    "method",
    "definition",
    "primes",
    "threads",
    "duration_ms",
    "polynomials",
    "tables"
  ],
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {
      "const": "root-tail/1"
    },
    "ts_ms": {
      "type": "integer",
      "minimum": 0
    },
    "from": {
      "type": "integer",
      "minimum": 2
    },
    "bound": {
      "type": "integer",
      "minimum": 3,
      "maximum": 4294967296
    },
    "bin_width": {
      "type": "number",
      "exclusiveMinimum": 0
    },
    "method": {
      "const": "projective-root-count"
    },
    "definition": {
      "const": "docs/baseline_calibration.md"
    },
    "primes": {
      "type": "integer",
      "minimum": 0
    },
    "threads": {
      "type": "integer",
      "minimum": 1
    },
    "duration_ms": {
      "type": "integer",
      "minimum": 0
    },
    "polynomials": {
      "type": "array",
      "minItems": 1,
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "instance",
          "path",
          "degree",
          "n_digits",
          "algebraic",
          "rational"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "instance": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 300
          },
          "path": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "degree": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 12
          },
          "n_digits": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1
          },
          "algebraic": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/side"
          },
          "rational": {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/side"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tables": {
      "type": "array",
      "items": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "name",
          "path",
          "columns",
          "rows",
          "description"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "path": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "columns": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "minLength": 1
            }
          },
          "rows": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "description": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "$defs": {
    "side": {
      "type": "object",
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "required": [
        "alpha_tail",
        "roots_per_prime"
      ],
      "properties": {
        "alpha_tail": {
          "type": "number"
        },
        "roots_per_prime": {
          "type": "number",
          "minimum": 0
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
